  (text "INTERLOCKS (independent of the MCU): GIN is a wired-AND node."
    (at 20 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 2a10d170-5a95-5bf7-95d6-282d65c71fad)
  )
  (text "U3A: pulse-length limiter. PL_CT charges from GATE_CMD through 68k/1uF; when it exceeds 0.6875 x 5 V the LM393 pulls GIN low."
    (at 20 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid a5c6aa82-e60d-5f7a-8442-73565a32cc09)
  )
  (text "      Window 63-96 ms (Monte-Carlo, doc 03 sec. 8); firmware limit 50 ms. Reset through D8/R48 when GATE_CMD returns low."
    (at 20 31.75 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 5a9288c6-247e-5ae8-a28b-3462f3411832)
  )
  (text "U3B: gate-drive UVLO. If VDRV < 8.0 V the LM393 pulls GIN low (prevents linear-mode operation of the MOSFETs)."
    (at 20 35.56 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid aaca7863-e0c9-5c68-a641-92b7a75752dc)
  )
  (text "R45 22k pull-down: GIN low when the MCU is reset or unpowered. GATE_FB lets the firmware verify the effective command."
    (at 20 39.37 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 7013b2d0-30f8-5c13-8166-deeebf81d96e)
  )
  (text "Foot switch: pull-up + RC + Schmitt + firmware re-confirmation for the whole trigger delay (fixes reference finding)."
    (at 20 41.91 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 785df420-fdea-5cfa-9527-4e0a97abd6d0)
  )
)
